{% comment %}
  Liquid product template.

  GitHub theme sync on this store has repeatedly skipped templates/product.json
  (it depended on sections that fail Theme Check). Shopify then has no product
  template, so /products/* returns HTTP 404 and the 404 "Search banner" layout.

  A Liquid template is accepted independently of those JSON section references.
  product.json is removed so this file is the only default product template.
{% endcomment %}

